# Options for the vinylclean-live service (see: vc-live --help).
# Settings made on the web page (sensitivity, sound card, sample rate...)
# are saved in ~/.config/vinylclean/settings.json and reloaded at startup:
# normally there is nothing to put here.
# An option written here OVERRIDES the saved setting at every start.
#
# Examples:  --http 8080          port of the control page
#            --device hw:0,0      force the sound card
# After editing:  sudo systemctl restart vinylclean-live
VC_OPTS="--http 8080"
